  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h1> The Value System for Modern Manufacturing </h1>",
   "body": "<p class=\"extra-large-text\">ZOLLER’s system-oriented approach is based on four core values: innovation, quality, precision, and service. We adhere to these values—in every product we develop, manufacture, and deliver. Our customers are satisfied because our values ensure performance. </p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/e/8/csm_value_system_4adb77b8bc.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1155,
     "h": 1034
    }
   ],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "right",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c607",
   "bg": "black",
   "space": {
    "before": "extra-small",
    "after": "none"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "values",
   "header": "",
   "tiles": [
    {
     "img": {
      "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/b/2/csm_value_innovation_30b03ea669.webp",
      "alt": "",
      "w": 739,
      "h": 774
     },
     "text": "<p>At ZOLLER, a commitment to innovation is the most important ingredient for progress. We’ve been shaping the future for 80 years. </p>"
    },
    {
     "img": {
      "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/1/f/csm_value_quality_596c87a5e7.webp",
      "alt": "",
      "w": 739,
      "h": 774
     },
     "text": "<p>At ZOLLER, experts assemble every device by hand. And they stand behind the results with their names: reliability made in Germany. </p>"
    },
    {
     "img": {
      "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/3/8/csm_value_precition_86c1763b85.webp",
      "alt": "",
      "w": 739,
      "h": 774
     },
     "text": "<p>At ZOLLER, we use state-of-the-art measuring technology. Our top-of-the-line devices can resolve structures smaller than 1 µm and deliver precise data. </p>"
    },
    {
     "img": {
      "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/9/6/csm_value_service_c143139351.webp",
      "alt": "",
      "w": 739,
      "h": 774
     },
     "text": "<p>At ZOLLER, reliability is what counts. You can reach us in 62 countries around the world. From Argentina to Vietnam, we’re here for you! </p>"
    }
   ],
   "ftype": "zoller_column-image-text",
   "id": "c605",
   "bg": "black",
   "space": {
    "before": "small",
    "after": "default"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Experience the ZOLLER System Firsthand </h2>",
   "body": "<p>At the ZOLLER Smart Factory in Pleidelsheim, we showcase the ZOLLER system with all its solutions, including complete shop floor automation. See for yourself the high efficiency of seamless CAM-to-part processes and the benefits of consistently available tool data. </p> <p>Find out more now about how to book your appointment for a visit or a one-on-one consultation with an »expert«.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ca/company/contact/smart-factory\">Visit the Smart Factory</a></p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/0/9/csm_smartfactory_teaser_4b2372736c.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1400,
     "h": 1400
    }
   ],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "right",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c59554",
   "bg": "lightgray",
   "space": {
    "before": "default",
    "after": "default"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Four Numbers as the Basis of the ZOLLER System </h2>",
   "body": "<p>Behind the ZOLLER system lies a continuously evolving development process. These four numbers bring it to life: 80 | 60 | 14 | 7. They clearly illustrate why ZOLLER is the best partner for all tool-related processes. Learn more in the flyer.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/fileadmin/03_Media_Press/Downloads/System/Flyer_ZOL_Vier_Zahlen_DE.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Download Flyer</a></p>",
   "images": [
